Bolt is closed source. The user agreement that comes with each build of
Bolt, USER-AGREEMENT.md, is what lets a person use it. Nobody may copy,
change, pass on or take apart Bolt, or any part of it, except as that
agreement allows.

Bolt is built with code that other people wrote. That code stays under
its own licenses, listed in the notices that come with each build:
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html and THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES-RUST.html.
